dates rust__module v1
description "A file whose alias has two underscores in a row. The Rust code is the module rust__module, and rustc's lint non_snake_case warns of the mod line that declares it, so the runner beside the code and a crate that uses it do not build with -D warnings (W001). The Wasm module declares the code by a name of its own, and every other target takes the alias as it is"

inputs
